0	section	Talking to Ava
1	line	Ava	Hello and welcome to my humble abode. It's sadly rather more humble than I'd like, to be honest. Perhaps you can help with that?
1	select	Start the Animal Magnetism quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	I would be happy to make your home a better place.
2	line	Ava	Yay, I didn't even have to talk about a reward; you're more gullible than most adventurers, that's for sure.
2	line	Ava	Don't worry, though; I just need you to help fix this vile old bed for me. Then I'll find a suitable reward for you.
2	line	Player	Great, will I be able to take a nap in it?
2	line	Ava	Don't be silly; everyone knows that true warriors don't ever sleep...or perform many other bodily functions, for that matter. I'll come up with something, though.
2	line	Player	I'm not convinced by just a vague something; can you be a slight bit more inspiring in your offer?
2	line	Ava	What I need is simple: a couple of undead chickens. You should be able to pick some up at the farm near Port Phasmatys.
2	line	Ava	I'll use one for my bed, then see what I can make from the other in the way of a reward. I have some ideas involving infinite feathers.
2	action	Animal Magnetism is started.
2	line	Player	Very well then, I shall await my mystery prize with bated breath.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	I'm not much into interior design, to tell the truth.
2	line	Ava	Very well, I suppose I'll just have to resort to the Professor's patented sleeping aid in order to get some rest. It does so bruise my head, though.
2	action	end
0	section	Talking to Ava again
1	line	Ava	Do you need a reminder what you are supposed to do? I know you must have shiny beads distracting you, but it is an important job you are doing for me.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Yes, please.
2	line	Player	Yes, please.
2	line	Ava	...And people say we scientists are absent minded...
2	line	Ava	You need to fetch 2 undead chickens for me to use in my redecoration. It's not rocket science.
2	line	Player	Rocket?
2	line	Ava	If they existed, they would be like arrows but much, much bigger. Considering the mess you rangers make with small bits of stick, we scientists have decided they don't exist. Now get chicken hunting.
2	action	end
1	option	No, thank you, I just came to gossip with you.
2	line	Player	No thank you; I just came to gossip with you.
2	line	Ava	Well, the Witch next door has been cooking some rather nice gingerbread, but I don't think that counts as gossip.
2	line	Ava	Can you head off and do adventurous stuff, please? I hear the Wilderness is fun this time of year.
2	action	end
