1	line	Alice	Hello. How can I help you?
1	option	What are you selling?
1	option	Can you give me any Farming advice?
1	option	I'm okay, thank you.
1	option	I'm here about a quest.
2	line	Player	I'm here about a quest.
2	line	Player	I am after one of your, er, unhealthier poultry. Could you help me?
2	line	Alice	You need those useless, undead chickens? How odd you adventurers are.
2	line	Alice	You need to talk to my husband Malcolm, though - not that I can these days.
2	line	Player	Whyever would this be?
2	line	Alice	Can't you see, he is dead. I can't talk to the dead.
