0	section	Talking to Malcolm
1	line	Malcolm	Woo woo!
1	action	end
1	line	Player	Your animals don't look too healthy.
1	line	Malcolm	It's that fountain thingy in the temple to the east. It's turned them all into zombies.
1	line	Player	What use are zombie animals?
1	line	Malcolm	None at all, mate, except that those worshippers at that temple keep comin' and killin' 'em all for their bones. Don't ask me why.
1	line	Player	But you're a ghost - surely you know something about it.
1	line	Malcolm	I don't know nuthin' about nuthin'. Oim a simple ghost with simple needs. All I know is, years ago, that temple started glowing green and, a few months later, I woke up dead. That's all there is to it.
1	line	Malcolm	I do miss the wife though; tell 'er I still loves her.
1	line	Player	Would I be able to buy some of your chickens?
1	line	Malcolm	Talk to my wife and I'll think about it.
1	action	end
