1	line	Alice	Hello. How can I help you?
1	option	What are you selling?
1	option	Can you give me any Farming advice?
1	option	I'm okay, thank you.
1	option	I'm here about a quest.
2	line	Player	I'm here about a quest.
2	line	Player	I have a message from Malcolm. He wants you to know that he still loves you, despite his ghostly state.
2	line	Alice	The curse of undeath was so cruel; all the men out here succumbed, but Lyra and I were left alive.
2	line	Alice	Ever since that day, I've not been able to speak to him.
2	line	Alice	Tell him I love him but I can't find our savings. I know he had our collection of gold and 'prize cow' rosettes just before the curse struck.
2	line	Player	I'll have a word with him, then; magic has its uses I suppose.
2	action	end
