0	section	Speaking to the old crone after delivering the amulet
1	line	Player	I'm here about the farmers east of here.
1	line	Player	Hello there, just dropping in to thank you again. It all went perfectly. Alice and Malcolm can communicate again.
1	line	Old crone	I can't help but shed a tear about my own family. My sisters are so vile, I refuse to talk to them these days.
