1	line	Ava	I'm thrilled for you. What about my magnet?
1	line	Player	The process is subject to some unexpected delays.
1	line	Ava	I can see now why Fenkenstain prefers to work with dead folk. It can't be more frustrating than working with you.
1	action	end
