1	line	Player	Well, yes, although I seem to have mislaid it.
1	line	Ava	It's only the final, vital step in your quest that you decided to leave who-knows-where. Don't worry, I have plenty of spares.
1	line	Player	Why do I sense sarcasm somewhere here?
